maxGrade":0.0756}],"source":"Route: Lookout Mountain Road (Lariat Loop Scenic Byway) out-and-back, OpenStreetMap geometry (Overpass API, ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) routed along the OSM 'Lookout Mountain Road' ways through 8 waypoints. Bottom (start/finish): where 19th St becomes Lookout Mountain Rd (OSM name change, by the Lariat Loop gateway at the foot of the mountain in Golden, at or just below the start of the popular Strava climb segment); climb through the lower hairpins, the northern switchbacks and Windy Saddle, then south along the mountain side to the top at the Buffalo Bill Museum & Grave entrance road (Lookout Mountain Park); turn around and descend the same road. The return leg is the exact mirror of the climb (same samples, reversed). Elevation: USGS 3DEP (1 m lidar where available) via Elevation Point Query Service (https://epqs.nationalmap.gov/v1/json), sampled every ~12.5 m (DEM resolution(s) reported: 1 m); cross-checked against OpenTopoData ned10m; 62 m rolling median + 75 m centred moving average, resampled to ~25 m; grade cap 22% per step (applied to 0 steps)."}